---
// Custom landing page — agentstatedeveloper.dev
// Layout/structure modeled on ctxone.com; ASD purple color scheme retained.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AgentStateDeveloper — Code-level context and audit overlay for agent-authored code</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Decision ledger, effect declarations, and call graph for every function — queryable by agents over MCP, checked into git." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="AgentStateDeveloper" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Code-level context and audit overlay for agent-authored code." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://agentstatedeveloper.dev" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --accent: #8b5cf6;
      --accent-bright: #a78bfa;
      --accent-glow: #8b5cf633;
      --accent-subtle: #8b5cf618;
      --cyan: #a78bfa;
      --bg-primary: #0a0a14;
      --bg-secondary: #14101f;
      --bg-tertiary: #1f1a2e;
      --border: #2a2140;
      --border-strong: #3a2d5c;
      --text-primary: #e8e6f0;
      --text-secondary: #9b93b3;
      --text-muted: #6b6485;
      --success: #00ff88;
      --warning: #f59e0b;
      --radius: 12px;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --mono: 'SF Mono', 'JetBrains Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      --maxw: 1120px;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    a { color: var(--accent-bright); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }
    code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.9em; }
    .wrap { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-bright); font-weight: 600; }
    .eyebrow .dot { color: var(--accent); }

    /* Nav */
    .nav { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; background: rgba(10,10,20,0.72); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; max-width: var(--maxw); width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); }
    .nav-logo .glyph { width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 4px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9, #a78bfa); box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent-glow); }
    .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; }
    .nav-links a { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-primary); filter: none; }
    .nav-gh { border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 7px 14px !important; color: var(--text-primary) !important; }
    .nav-gh:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
    @media (max-width: 820px) { .nav-links a:not(.nav-gh) { display: none; } }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; border: 1px solid transparent; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.12); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px var(--accent-glow); }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--text-primary); border-color: var(--border-strong); }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-bright); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { position: relative; padding: 88px 0 72px; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 20% 0%, rgba(139,92,246,0.18), transparent 65%), radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 85% 10%, rgba(109,40,217,0.12), transparent 60%); }
    .hero .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 58px; line-height: 0.98; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -2.4px; margin: 22px 0 24px; max-width: 800px; text-wrap: balance; }
    .hero h1 .accent { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .hero .lead { font-size: 19px; color: var(--text-primary); max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .hero .lead strong { font-weight: 700; }
    .hero .sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .hero .sub .kw { color: var(--accent-bright); font-weight: 600; }
    .hero .sub .kw.warn { color: var(--warning); }

    /* Install card */
    .install { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-secondary), var(--bg-primary)); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px; max-width: 720px; box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
    .install-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .install-head .bolt { font-size: 16px; }
    .install-head .t { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
    .install-head .spacer { flex: 1; }
    .install-head .mini { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--text-muted); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 5px; padding: 4px 9px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .install-head .mini:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .install pre { background: var(--bg-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 14px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-secondary); overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; }
    .install pre .c { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .install-or { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 18px 0 10px; }
    .tabs { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tab { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 13px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-secondary); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; background: transparent; }
    .tab .os { display: block; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 1px; }
    .tab.active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-bright); background: var(--accent-subtle); }
    .cmd-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: var(--bg-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 11px 14px; }
    .cmd-row .dollar { color: var(--accent); font-family: var(--mono); }
    .cmd-row code { flex: 1; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 12.5px; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
    .cmd-row .copy { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--text-muted); cursor: pointer; }
    .cmd-row .copy:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); }

    .runs-on { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .chip { font-size: 11px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-secondary); }

    .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .feat-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
    .feat { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
    .feat::before { content: ''; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); }

    /* Stat band — contained card with inset dividers + glow */
    .stats { padding: 20px 0 8px; }
    .stats-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,16,31,0.55), rgba(10,10,20,0.25)); overflow: hidden; }
    .stat { padding: 38px 24px; text-align: center; position: relative; }
    .stat + .stat::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 24px; bottom: 24px; width: 1px; background: var(--border); }
    .stat .n { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-bright); letter-spacing: -1.5px; line-height: 1; text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow); }
    .stat .l { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 10px; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .stats-card { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .stat:nth-child(3)::before, .stat:nth-child(2) + .stat::before { display: none; } .stat:nth-child(3), .stat:nth-child(4) { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); } }

    /* Sections */
    .section { padding: 84px 0; }
    .section-head { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .section-head.center { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center; }
    .section-head h2 { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.8px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .section-head p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }

    /* Card grid (architecture / capabilities) */
    .card-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
    .card-grid.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .card-grid.cols-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .card { background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 22px; transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; }
    .card:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .card .slug { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent-bright); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
    .card pre { margin-top: 14px; background: var(--bg-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 12px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-secondary); overflow-x: auto; }
    .card pre .p { color: var(--accent); }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .card-grid.cols-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .card-grid.cols-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* Numbered pillars (moments) */
    .pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .pillar { background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 26px; }
    .pillar .num { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--accent-bright); margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .pillar h3 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .pillar p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .pillar .answer { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-primary); line-height: 1.6; }
    .pillar .answer strong { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .pillar code { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* Mockups (reused for the moments) */
    .mockup { background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 16px; }
    .mockup-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .mockup-header .title { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary); }
    .mockup-header .badge-sm { font-size: 9px; color: var(--accent-bright); background: var(--accent-subtle); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: auto; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .blame-output { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .blame-output .label { color: var(--text-muted); }
    .blame-output .value { color: var(--text-primary); }
    .blame-output .agent { color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .blame-output .time { color: var(--cyan); }
    .blame-output .reason { color: var(--warning); font-style: italic; }
    .moment { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .moment:nth-child(even) .moment-text { order: 2; }
    @media (max-width: 880px) { .moment { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; } .moment:nth-child(even) .moment-text { order: 0; } }

    /* Pairs-with */
    .pairs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 36px; }
    .pairs h2 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin: 10px 0 14px; }
    .pairs p { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .pairs .integ { background: var(--bg-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 18px; }
    .pairs .integ .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border); font-size: 13px; }
    .pairs .integ .row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .pairs .integ .row .k { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--accent-bright); }
    .pairs .integ .row .v { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
    @media (max-width: 880px) { .pairs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 26px; } }

    /* Editions */
    .editions { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .edition { background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .edition.featured { border-color: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent-glow), 0 8px 30px var(--accent-glow); }
    .edition .tier { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--accent-bright); text-transform: uppercase; }
    .edition .price { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
    .edition .who { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .edition ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .edition li { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); display: flex; gap: 9px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .edition li::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--success); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .edition .btn { margin-top: auto; justify-content: center; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) { .editions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    /* Footer */
    .footer { background: var(--bg-secondary); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 52px 0 28px; }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto 32px; padding: 0 24px; }
    .footer-brand .nav-logo { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .footer-brand p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; max-width: 260px; }
    .footer-col h4 { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .footer-col a { display: block; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 13px; padding: 4px 0; }
    .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); filter: none; }
    .footer-bottom { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

    [data-reveal] { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94), transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94); }
    [data-reveal].revealed { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 38px; }
      .hero { padding: 56px 0 48px; }
      .section { padding: 60px 0; }
      .section-head h2 { font-size: 26px; }
      .stat .n { font-size: 32px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <span class="nav-logo"><span class="glyph"></span>AgentStateDeveloper</span>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#architecture">Architecture</a>
      <a href="#capabilities">Capabilities</a>
      <a href="#editions">Editions</a>
      <a href="/guides/introduction/">Docs</a>
      <a class="nav-gh" href="https://github.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot">●</span> ASD // the code-context overlay for agents</span>
    <h1>Your agents write code they don't remember deciding. <span class="accent">ASD gives them the paper trail.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">AgentStateDeveloper is a <strong>code-level context and audit overlay</strong> for agent-authored code — a decision ledger, effect declarations, and a call graph for every function, all queryable by the agents that write the code.</p>
    <p class="sub">Under the hood it's a git-native sidecar that travels with the repo: <span class="kw">why</span> a function exists, <span class="kw">what</span> it's allowed to touch, and <span class="kw warn">who</span> approved the last change — served over MCP. Rust core. 9 languages. Zero telemetry.</p>

    <!-- Install card -->
    <div class="install">
      <div class="install-head">
        <span class="bolt">⚡</span>
        <span class="t">Let your agent install it</span>
        <span class="spacer"></span>
        <span class="mini" id="copy-prompt">COPY PROMPT</span>
      </div>
      <pre id="agent-prompt">Set up AgentStateDeveloper for this repository. Run each step, then report back once asd is installed, this repo is indexed, and the MCP server is connected.

<span class="c">1. brew install asd</span>   — install the asd, asd-mcp, and asd-serve binaries
<span class="c">2. asd onboard</span>        — index the repo and register the MCP server (project-scoped)</pre>

      <div class="install-or">OR INSTALL DIRECTLY</div>
      <div class="tabs" id="tabs">
        <button class="tab active" data-cmd="brew tap agentstatelabs/agentstatedeveloper && brew install asd">Homebrew<span class="os">macOS · Linux</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-cmd="curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper/main/install.sh | sh">Shell<span class="os">macOS · Linux</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-cmd="iwr https://raw.githubusercontent.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper/main/install.ps1 | iex">PowerShell<span class="os">Windows</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="cmd-row">
        <span class="dollar">$</span>
        <code id="install-cmd">brew tap agentstatelabs/agentstatedeveloper && brew install asd</code>
        <span class="copy" id="copy-cmd">COPY</span>
      </div>
      <div class="runs-on">
        RUNS ON
        <span class="chip">macOS · Apple Silicon</span>
        <span class="chip">macOS · Intel</span>
        <span class="chip">Linux</span>
        <span class="chip">Windows</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/guides/quickstart/">Get started →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/agentstatelabs/AgentStateDeveloper" target="_blank">View on GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feat-row">
      <span class="feat">64 MCP tools</span>
      <span class="feat">Git-native sidecar</span>
      <span class="feat">9 languages</span>
      <span class="feat">BSL-1.1 → Apache 2.0</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STAT BAND -->
<div class="stats">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats-card">
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">64</div><div class="l">MCP tools</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">8</div><div class="l">Primitives</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">3</div><div class="l">Surfaces</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n">9</div><div class="l">Languages</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ARCHITECTURE -->
<section class="section" id="architecture">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Architecture //</span>
      <h2>One overlay. Three surfaces.</h2>
      <p>ASD isn't a library you import — it's a sidecar that lives in <code>.asd/</code>, travels with every clone, and exposes the same graph to your shell, your coding agents, and the browser.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid cols-3" data-reveal>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">cli/</div>
        <h3>asd</h3>
        <p>Everything the agents can do, you can do from a shell: index, read a symbol, query effects, append and ratify ledger entries, tail the audit log.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd read payments.chargeCard
<span class="p">$</span> asd effects_of processOrder</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">mcp/</div>
        <h3>asd-mcp</h3>
        <p>A stdio MCP server exposing 64 tools to Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and Gemini — code search, call graph, effects, and ledger, right where the agent works.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd onboard   <span style="color:var(--text-muted)"># registers MCP</span></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">http/</div>
        <h3>asd-serve</h3>
        <p>An HTTP surface plus Lens — a browser view of the ledger, effects, call graph, and hash-chained audit trail for humans reviewing what agents decided.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd-serve --port 7777</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAPABILITIES -->
<section class="section" id="capabilities">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Capabilities //</span>
      <h2>Eight primitives, one sidecar.</h2>
      <p>Each primitive answers a question an agent needs settled before it reads, writes, or refactors — exposed identically to your tools (MCP) and to you (the <code>asd</code> CLI).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid cols-2" data-reveal>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">ledger</div>
        <h3>Why does this function exist?</h3>
        <p>Hazards, rationale, constraints, and authority — checked into git, surviving renames, file moves, and the original author leaving.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd ledger get payments.chargeCard
<span class="p">$</span> asd ledger append --kind hazard</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">effects</div>
        <h3>What does it actually touch?</h3>
        <p>A propagated 17-category effect set — <code>io.fs.read</code>, <code>io.db.write</code>, <code>io.net.out</code> — with each effect annotated by where it was declared.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd effects_of processOrder</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">call_graph</div>
        <h3>What calls what?</h3>
        <p>Callers and callees for any symbol, so an agent can compute the blast radius before it changes a line.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd callers_of billing.computeProration</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">policy</div>
        <h3>Who's allowed to change it?</h3>
        <p>Declarative gates that decide whether a write requires approval — evaluated on every ledger mutation.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd policy eval billing/*</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">ratification</div>
        <h3>Who approved this decision?</h3>
        <p>Signed approvals (ed25519) attached to ledger entries, so a decision carries its authority with it.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd ledger approve payments.chargeCard</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="slug">audit</div>
        <h3>What happened, in order?</h3>
        <p>A tamper-evident, hash-chained log of every ledger mutation and policy decision — replayable and independently verifiable.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">$</span> asd audit tail --path billing/*</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

